{"slug":"salesforce-crm-online-training","id":"3929","title":"Salesforce CRM Online Training","description":"<h3>About SALESFORCE CRM Online Training:</h3>\n<p>Salesforce Customer Relationship Management usually pronounced as Salesforce CRM which has began with the vision of re-inventing CRM. the main role of Salesforce is to run entirely within the cloud storage and there’s no need of setup costs which helps your workers to try to to work from any device just with an online connection either it’s going to be a smartphone, tablet, laptop or PC. Salesforce CRM Online Training  is straightforward to work for little business also as large business organizations. It not only starts and end with CRM for sales and marketing but also enables you to manage all interactions together with your customers.</p>\n<h3>Prerequisites</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Core Java</strong> or Any Programming Language</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Terms And Conditions</h3>\n<ul class=\"list-style\">\n<li>We will Provide Supporting to resolve Student practical Issues.</li>\n<li>We will provide server Access and 100% Lab Facility.</li>\n<li>Resume Preparation.</li>\n<li>Interview Questions &amp; Answers.</li>\n<li>We will conduct mock interviews. Student also gets 100% supporting before and after getting job.</li>\n</ul>","curriculumInfo":"5 Sections52 Lessons10 Weeks","sections":[{"id":"47","title":"SALESFORCE CRM Online Training Course Content","count":"2","collapsed":true,"items":[{"id":"3935","order":1,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/salesforce-crm-online-training/lessons/definition-of-cloud-computing-and-types/","number":"2.1","title":"Definition Of Cloud Computing And Types","status":"locked"},{"id":"3936","order":2,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/salesforce-crm-online-training/lessons/definition-of-salesforce-and-its-products/","number":"2.2","title":"Definition Of Salesforce And It’s Products","status":"locked"}]},{"id":"48","title":"SALESFORCE Administration","count":"19","collapsed":true,"items":